1. [<span class="qcm-letter">A</span> Le mariage religieux uniquement.](BIL_ITEM_CR_173_FAUX)
1. [<span class="qcm-letter">B</span> Le PACS.](BIL_ITEM_CR_173_FAUX)
1. [<span class="qcm-letter">C</span> Les fiançailles.](BIL_ITEM_CR_173_FAUX)
