## BIL_ITEM_NAT_011_VRAI
`if !@bilAnswerKeys.includes("|c696ca0a2ff4|")`
`@bilAnswerKeys = calc(@bilAnswerKeys+"|c696ca0a2ff4|")`
`@bilAnswered = calc(@bilAnswered+1)`
