1. [<span class="qcm-letter">A</span> 4 ans.](BIL_ITEM_NAT_057_FAUX)
1. [<span class="qcm-letter">B</span> 6 ans.](BIL_ITEM_NAT_057_FAUX)
1. [<span class="qcm-letter">C</span> 7 ans.](BIL_ITEM_NAT_057_FAUX)
