## BIL_ITEM_NAT_207_VRAI
`if !@bilAnswerKeys.includes("|f67597e5fbfe|")`
`@bilAnswerKeys = calc(@bilAnswerKeys+"|f67597e5fbfe|")`
`@bilAnswered = calc(@bilAnswered+1)`
